+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Cpu timer load value(Low 32 bits)
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00010 PTMTimerEn           (P)
+///               %unsigned 1  PTMTimerEn                0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * PTM timer enable
