+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Start address of the region to be secured/restricted.
+///                                    * Bits [1:0] unused.
+///                                    ###
+///     @ 0x00008 seEnd                (P)
+///               %unsigned 32 seEnd                     0xF7CA1FFF
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * Used in conjunction with seStart to define region size
+///                                    * Bits [1:0] unused
+///                                    ###
+///     # # ----------------------------------------------------------
+/// $ENDOFINTERFACE  # size:      12B, bits:      69b, padding:     0B
